1
00:01:43,400 --> 00:01:46,900
"The Missing Piece"

2
00:01:47,100 --> 00:01:51,800
(Episode 1)

3
00:02:31,000 --> 00:02:35,500
(Ji Mingxuan)

4
00:02:49,520 --> 00:02:50,920
Zhou Yang is coming back tomorrow.

5
00:02:58,500 --> 00:03:01,200
(Shen Mo)

6
00:03:07,479 --> 00:03:09,560
Just hearing your ex's name

7
00:03:11,639 --> 00:03:13,159
is enough to make you lose your cool.

8
00:03:27,759 --> 00:03:28,759
Zhou Yang.

9
00:03:30,159 --> 00:03:33,159
I thought I'd never hear that name again.

10
00:03:53,520 --> 00:03:55,879
I'm just a tool for
Mr. Ji to vent his desires.

11
00:03:57,360 --> 00:03:58,560
Once he's had his release,

12
00:03:59,360 --> 00:04:00,960
I'll naturally be tossed aside.

13
00:04:45,800 --> 00:04:46,920
I love you.

14
00:04:55,120 --> 00:04:56,120
I love you too.

15
00:06:06,360 --> 00:06:07,360
Mr. Ji.

16
00:06:08,680 --> 00:06:09,680
Want some breakfast?

17
00:06:12,160 --> 00:06:14,000
Aren't you going to
the office today, Mr. Ji?

18
00:06:15,360 --> 00:06:17,160
I'm picking someone
up at the airport today.

19
00:06:18,240 --> 00:06:19,240
Who?

20
00:06:19,319 --> 00:06:20,319
Zhou Yang.

21
00:06:22,120 --> 00:06:23,600
Ji An'an is coming back today too.

22
00:06:28,759 --> 00:06:29,759
You're coming with me.

23
00:06:32,560 --> 00:06:33,560
Got a problem with that?

24
00:06:37,360 --> 00:06:38,360
No.

25
00:06:48,360 --> 00:06:49,600
Make yourself presentable.

26
00:06:52,079 --> 00:06:53,079
Don't embarrass me.

27
00:06:53,879 --> 00:06:54,879
Okay.

28
00:07:03,480 --> 00:07:04,840
What are you supposed to call me?

29
00:07:07,480 --> 00:07:08,480
Mingxuan.

30
00:07:08,920 --> 00:07:10,920
Don't forget what our relationship is.

31
00:07:14,360 --> 00:07:15,360
Lovers.

32
00:07:22,179 --> 00:07:23,179
Fake ones.

33
00:07:28,319 --> 00:07:29,319
There they are.

34
00:07:33,839 --> 00:07:34,839
Mingxuan!

35
00:07:35,079 --> 00:07:36,480
How have you been abroad?

36
00:07:37,120 --> 00:07:38,120
Everything's been great.

37
00:07:38,160 --> 00:07:39,560
Except you weren't there.

38
00:07:40,040 --> 00:07:42,000
I flew out to see you
four or five times a year.

39
00:07:42,160 --> 00:07:42,959
Wasn't that enough?

40
00:07:42,960 --> 00:07:44,958
There are 365 days in a year,

41
00:07:44,959 --> 00:07:46,375
(Ji An'an)
and you only came four or five times.

42
00:07:46,399 --> 00:07:47,319
How could that be enough?

43
00:07:47,319 --> 00:07:48,319
Mr. Ji.

44
00:07:59,120 --> 00:08:00,120
Hello.

45
00:08:03,079 --> 00:08:04,240
This is Shen Mo.

46
00:08:06,439 --> 00:08:07,439
Shen Mo.

47
00:08:07,480 --> 00:08:08,720
Just call me An'an.

48
00:08:09,439 --> 00:08:10,600
This is Zhou Yang,

49
00:08:11,000 --> 00:08:12,399
my sister's boyfriend.

50
00:08:17,439 --> 00:08:18,559
Nice to meet you, Mr. Zhou.

51
00:08:21,040 --> 00:08:22,040
What a coincidence.

52
00:08:22,360 --> 00:08:24,160
Mr. Shen and I went
to high school together.

53
00:08:24,360 --> 00:08:25,560
Don't you remember, Mr. Shen?

54
00:08:28,199 --> 00:08:29,199
I'm sorry.

55
00:08:30,079 --> 00:08:31,159
My memory isn't very good.

56
00:08:35,360 --> 00:08:36,360
I'm starving.

57
00:08:38,919 --> 00:08:40,120
What do you want for lunch?

58
00:08:40,399 --> 00:08:41,399
Seafood.

59
00:08:41,559 --> 00:08:42,559
Seafood won't work.

60
00:08:42,759 --> 00:08:44,440
I'll take you out for it another day.

61
00:08:44,720 --> 00:08:45,720
Why?

62
00:08:47,480 --> 00:08:49,000
This guy's allergic to seafood.

63
00:08:54,120 --> 00:08:55,400
Then let's have something else.

64
00:08:57,879 --> 00:08:58,879
Let's go.

65
00:09:01,320 --> 00:09:02,320
Zhou Yang.

66
00:09:03,360 --> 00:09:05,559
You're the one who pushed me into hell.

67
00:09:13,080 --> 00:09:14,720
Here's to welcoming our An'an home.

68
00:09:22,440 --> 00:09:23,679
I'm finally back.

69
00:09:24,320 --> 00:09:25,758
England is such an awful place.

70
00:09:25,759 --> 00:09:27,519
It's overcast all year round.

71
00:09:27,759 --> 00:09:29,600
I woke up to fries every day

72
00:09:29,799 --> 00:09:31,135
and went to sleep
thinking about fried fish.

73
00:09:31,159 --> 00:09:32,199
It's so much better to be home.

74
00:09:32,200 --> 00:09:32,879
Yeah.

75
00:09:32,960 --> 00:09:34,440
Sounds like all you did was eat.

76
00:09:35,799 --> 00:09:36,799
Of course not.

77
00:09:37,639 --> 00:09:39,439
The most important thing is being here

78
00:09:39,440 --> 00:09:41,080
with my beloved big brother.

79
00:09:42,080 --> 00:09:45,000
Isn't having Zhou Yang with you enough?

80
00:09:45,399 --> 00:09:45,879
No.

81
00:09:46,399 --> 00:09:46,840
I don't care.

82
00:09:47,159 --> 00:09:48,159
I want you both.

83
00:09:48,519 --> 00:09:49,519
Go ahead and eat.

84
00:09:54,000 --> 00:09:55,000
Have some more.

85
00:09:55,960 --> 00:09:56,960
Okay.

86
00:10:03,559 --> 00:10:04,559
Next time,

87
00:10:04,799 --> 00:10:06,759
I'll take you out for
your favorite roast duck.

88
00:10:08,840 --> 00:10:10,039
Mingxuan.

89
00:10:10,600 --> 00:10:13,080
Keep that up and I'm
really going to get jealous.

90
00:10:15,159 --> 00:10:16,879
Do you like roast duck, Mr. Shen?

91
00:10:17,879 --> 00:10:18,879
Oh.

92
00:10:20,120 --> 00:10:21,720
I usually prefer Chinese food.

93
00:10:22,320 --> 00:10:23,720
We were classmates for three years,

94
00:10:24,039 --> 00:10:25,919
but I never knew you
were allergic to seafood.

95
00:10:29,320 --> 00:10:30,799
It's not important.

96
00:10:31,519 --> 00:10:33,240
There was no need to tell everyone.

97
00:10:34,039 --> 00:10:36,200
Weren't you two classmates?

98
00:10:36,440 --> 00:10:38,240
Why are you being so
formal with each other?

99
00:10:39,080 --> 00:10:41,679
Mr. Shen and I weren't that close.

100
00:10:44,960 --> 00:10:46,640
When are you two planning to get married?

101
00:10:48,080 --> 00:10:49,080
Mingxuan!

102
00:10:49,159 --> 00:10:49,639
What?

103
00:10:49,759 --> 00:10:52,399
Are you going to date forever?

104
00:10:53,039 --> 00:10:54,320
Even if I'm okay with it,

105
00:10:55,320 --> 00:10:57,600
Zhou Yang's parents won't be, right?

106
00:10:57,639 --> 00:10:58,879
We just got back.

107
00:10:59,120 --> 00:11:00,680
We still have so much to take care of.

108
00:11:01,639 --> 00:11:03,639
Besides, Zhou Yang and I already agreed

109
00:11:05,039 --> 00:11:06,559
to wait until his career is stable

110
00:11:06,720 --> 00:11:08,279
before deciding on our next step.

111
00:11:09,000 --> 00:11:11,216
Aren't you afraid your boyfriend
will leave you for someone else?

112
00:11:11,240 --> 00:11:12,240
Of course not.

113
00:11:13,000 --> 00:11:14,600
My Zhou Yang would never do that.

114
00:11:19,559 --> 00:11:20,679
I'm going to the restroom.

115
00:11:22,399 --> 00:11:23,480
Right this way, sir.

116
00:11:47,679 --> 00:11:48,679
Mr. Ji.

117
00:11:50,519 --> 00:11:51,519
What are you doing here?

118
00:11:54,039 --> 00:11:57,799
How does it feel seeing
your old flame again?

119
00:12:03,759 --> 00:12:04,840
I don't feel anything.

120
00:12:10,320 --> 00:12:12,240
Don't you want to rekindle the flame?

121
00:12:14,279 --> 00:12:15,840
Throughout that entire meal,

122
00:12:17,559 --> 00:12:19,158
you and Zhou Yang kept

123
00:12:19,159 --> 00:12:20,239
making eyes at each other.

124
00:12:23,679 --> 00:12:25,200
You must've imagined it, Mr. Ji.

125
00:12:26,759 --> 00:12:28,240
I know what I'm supposed to do.

126
00:12:42,559 --> 00:12:44,279
So you've learned to talk back.

127
00:12:46,440 --> 00:12:47,919
You met An'an today.

128
00:12:48,399 --> 00:12:49,480
What do you think of her?

129
00:12:55,120 --> 00:12:56,559
Ms. Ji is sweet and innocent.

130
00:12:57,720 --> 00:12:58,840
She's very likable.

131
00:13:01,360 --> 00:13:05,759
That silly girl has loved
Zhou Yang since she was little.

132
00:13:08,440 --> 00:13:09,878
So I don't care whether Zhou Yang

133
00:13:09,879 --> 00:13:11,518
loves men or women

134
00:13:11,519 --> 00:13:12,960
or someone in a coma.

135
00:13:15,879 --> 00:13:17,639
As long as Ji An'an wants him,

136
00:13:19,000 --> 00:13:20,840
he belongs to her.

137
00:13:22,720 --> 00:13:23,720
Understand?

138
00:13:27,960 --> 00:13:28,960
Yes.

139
00:13:30,240 --> 00:13:31,240
I understand.

140
00:13:34,440 --> 00:13:36,639
I won't have anything to
do with Zhou Yang again.

141
00:13:43,639 --> 00:13:44,879
Good.

142
00:13:47,159 --> 00:13:48,879
As long as you behave and cooperate,

143
00:13:49,960 --> 00:13:52,039
there won't be any trouble.

144
00:13:55,080 --> 00:13:56,080
Mr. Ji.

145
00:14:00,639 --> 00:14:02,039
I'll head home, then.

146
00:14:35,600 --> 00:14:36,399
Let go of me.

147
00:14:36,400 --> 00:14:38,519
What are you doing, Mr. Ji?

148
00:14:39,519 --> 00:14:40,840
We're in public.

149
00:14:41,279 --> 00:14:42,279
Shh.

150
00:14:43,480 --> 00:14:44,959
Do you want everyone in the restaurant

151
00:14:44,960 --> 00:14:46,000
to come out here?

152
00:14:56,159 --> 00:14:57,159
What did you call me?

153
00:14:59,600 --> 00:15:01,320
M-Mingxuan.

154
00:15:10,759 --> 00:15:11,759
Good boy.

155
00:15:45,440 --> 00:15:46,440
Zhou Yang.

156
00:15:48,679 --> 00:15:49,840
Seen enough?

157
00:15:51,320 --> 00:15:52,600
You two were gone for a while.

158
00:15:52,799 --> 00:15:54,039
An'an was worried,

159
00:15:54,120 --> 00:15:55,440
so she asked me to check on you.

160
00:15:55,966 --> 00:15:56,966
Oh.

161
00:15:58,679 --> 00:15:59,679
It's nothing.

162
00:15:59,840 --> 00:16:01,840
Shen Mo isn't feeling well.

163
00:16:03,519 --> 00:16:04,959
Should we take him to the hospital?

164
00:16:05,840 --> 00:16:06,840
No.

165
00:16:07,919 --> 00:16:10,320
I'll have the driver take him home.

166
00:16:10,679 --> 00:16:11,480
Mr. Ji.

167
00:16:11,481 --> 00:16:13,639
You can call me Mingxuan, like An'an does.

168
00:16:15,480 --> 00:16:16,960
After all, it won't be long

169
00:16:18,399 --> 00:16:20,000
before we're family.

170
00:16:27,240 --> 00:16:29,360
So you did that on purpose, Mr. Ji.

171
00:16:32,080 --> 00:16:33,080
What do you think?

172
00:16:37,639 --> 00:16:38,639
Believe me,

173
00:16:39,399 --> 00:16:41,919
Zhou Yang will be engaged
to my sister very soon.

174
00:16:43,960 --> 00:16:45,480
When Mr. Ji wants something done,

175
00:16:47,879 --> 00:16:49,279
nothing can stop him.

176
00:16:50,519 --> 00:16:51,799
Go home and wait for me.

177
00:17:06,039 --> 00:17:07,039
Shen Mo.

178
00:17:08,279 --> 00:17:09,279
An'an.

179
00:17:11,319 --> 00:17:12,319
How are you?

180
00:17:12,519 --> 00:17:13,880
Are you feeling better?

181
00:17:14,599 --> 00:17:16,200
Yeah, I was just a little tired.

182
00:17:16,480 --> 00:17:17,599
I'm much better now.

183
00:17:18,319 --> 00:17:19,279
I'm sorry

184
00:17:19,280 --> 00:17:21,095
you didn't get to have
seafood because of me.

185
00:17:21,119 --> 00:17:23,558
It's okay. Mingxuan told me

186
00:17:23,559 --> 00:17:25,640
he'd treat me to the
freshest seafood later.

187
00:17:26,480 --> 00:17:28,000
You two didn't have dinner together?

188
00:17:28,559 --> 00:17:29,359
No.

189
00:17:29,559 --> 00:17:30,656
Mingxuan had something to do.

190
00:17:30,680 --> 00:17:32,599
So I stopped by Zhou
Yang's place for dinner.

191
00:17:32,640 --> 00:17:34,720
I hadn't seen his parents in ages.

192
00:17:37,359 --> 00:17:39,400
I heard your families go way back.

193
00:17:40,400 --> 00:17:43,119
His parents must really like you.

194
00:17:44,640 --> 00:17:47,200
Our families are very close.

195
00:17:47,559 --> 00:17:50,119
Zhou Yang and I
practically grew up together.

196
00:17:50,680 --> 00:17:51,960
But Zhou Yang

197
00:17:52,079 --> 00:17:53,400
has always been so reserved.

198
00:17:54,160 --> 00:17:55,759
I always had to make the first move.

199
00:17:56,319 --> 00:17:58,119
He got a little better
after we went abroad.

200
00:18:00,440 --> 00:18:01,440
Shen Mo.

201
00:18:01,680 --> 00:18:02,680
I heard that

202
00:18:02,880 --> 00:18:05,680
when two people are
each other's first love,

203
00:18:06,039 --> 00:18:08,039
their relationship is stronger.

204
00:18:08,480 --> 00:18:09,880
Do you think that's true?

205
00:18:11,599 --> 00:18:12,599
Of course.

206
00:18:15,480 --> 00:18:17,000
But it's already ten.

207
00:18:17,119 --> 00:18:18,759
Why isn't Mingxuan back yet?

208
00:18:18,920 --> 00:18:21,400
His business dinners usually run late.

209
00:18:24,119 --> 00:18:25,079
Or rather,

210
00:18:25,080 --> 00:18:27,759
Mr. Ji usually doesn't come home at night.

211
00:18:28,960 --> 00:18:29,759
Shen Mo.

212
00:18:29,880 --> 00:18:31,480
You're so patient.

213
00:18:31,599 --> 00:18:32,798
If I were you,

214
00:18:32,799 --> 00:18:34,599
I would've started a
fight with him already.

215
00:18:35,200 --> 00:18:36,839
How did you two meet?

216
00:18:37,400 --> 00:18:38,880
Was it love at first sight,

217
00:18:39,359 --> 00:18:41,039
or did you fall for each other over time?

218
00:18:42,160 --> 00:18:43,160
Tell me.

219
00:18:45,119 --> 00:18:46,119
Mr. Ji

220
00:18:48,160 --> 00:18:49,160
saved my life.

221
00:19:02,400 --> 00:19:04,440
Shen Mo, could you
design a promotional poster?

222
00:19:05,039 --> 00:19:06,200
I don't know how.

223
00:19:07,440 --> 00:19:09,200
Didn't you major in art in college?

224
00:19:11,200 --> 00:19:12,240
I really can't do it.

225
00:19:13,079 --> 00:19:14,399
Then what did you study art for?

226
00:19:14,680 --> 00:19:16,119
Just say you don't want to do it.

227
00:19:16,880 --> 00:19:18,080
Claiming you can't even draw.

228
00:19:19,480 --> 00:19:20,480
Look.

229
00:19:20,640 --> 00:19:23,400
Shen Mo's been pretty cocky at work lately.

230
00:19:23,720 --> 00:19:25,280
He's got someone powerful backing him.

231
00:19:25,640 --> 00:19:26,640
Who?

232
00:19:26,839 --> 00:19:27,839
You know, that man.

233
00:19:27,839 --> 00:19:28,839
Mr. Ji.

234
00:19:29,319 --> 00:19:30,319
No way.

235
00:19:30,440 --> 00:19:32,359
Wasn't Mr. Ji rumored to be involved

236
00:19:32,640 --> 00:19:33,679
with that movie star?

237
00:19:33,680 --> 00:19:34,838
He's rich.

238
00:19:34,839 --> 00:19:36,240
Why would he have only one lover?

239
00:19:38,160 --> 00:19:38,680
Look.

240
00:19:39,119 --> 00:19:41,440
You saw him and didn't even tell me.

241
00:20:30,200 --> 00:20:31,200
Shen Mo.

242
00:20:33,039 --> 00:20:34,039
Get in.

243
00:20:34,480 --> 00:20:35,480
Why?

244
00:20:36,680 --> 00:20:38,400
I just want to take you out to dinner.

245
00:20:41,240 --> 00:20:42,240
What about Miss Ji?

246
00:20:43,640 --> 00:20:44,720
I'm asking you to dinner.

247
00:20:45,400 --> 00:20:46,760
What does she have to do with it?

248
00:20:46,880 --> 00:20:48,440
It wouldn't be appropriate

249
00:20:48,960 --> 00:20:50,216
for just the two of us to have dinner.

250
00:20:50,240 --> 00:20:51,679
Even though we've broken up,

251
00:20:51,680 --> 00:20:53,560
we're still high school
classmates, aren't we?

252
00:20:53,799 --> 00:20:55,240
Can't we have dinner together?

253
00:20:56,319 --> 00:20:57,559
Xiao Mo, get in.

254
00:20:58,000 --> 00:20:59,359
I'm not leaving until you do.

255
00:21:18,200 --> 00:21:19,640
This way, Mr. Shen.

256
00:21:24,160 --> 00:21:25,160
Please.

257
00:21:33,440 --> 00:21:34,440
You're here.

258
00:21:38,000 --> 00:21:39,400
You're really allergic to seafood?

259
00:21:42,240 --> 00:21:43,240
What did you think?

260
00:21:44,240 --> 00:21:45,480
Why would I lie about that?

261
00:21:46,359 --> 00:21:47,920
Is that why you asked me here?

262
00:21:48,839 --> 00:21:50,160
Then how come I didn't know?

263
00:21:52,400 --> 00:21:53,400
I told you.

264
00:21:54,200 --> 00:21:55,240
You must've forgotten.

265
00:21:57,200 --> 00:21:58,680
Of course Ji Mingxuan

266
00:21:59,039 --> 00:22:00,160
knows everything

267
00:22:00,640 --> 00:22:01,680
and remembers everything.

268
00:22:03,960 --> 00:22:04,680
Should I

269
00:22:04,681 --> 00:22:06,279
order you some vegetables, then?

270
00:22:09,240 --> 00:22:10,240
Of course.

271
00:22:10,759 --> 00:22:12,759
Mr. Ji has to make the act convincing.

272
00:22:15,240 --> 00:22:16,240
Don't bother.

273
00:22:16,880 --> 00:22:17,880
I've lost my appetite.

274
00:22:31,359 --> 00:22:34,279
How have you been these past two years?

275
00:22:37,640 --> 00:22:38,640
Pretty good.

276
00:22:39,400 --> 00:22:42,240
I thought you'd pursue a career in art.

277
00:22:42,559 --> 00:22:44,839
What I do for a living is my choice.

278
00:22:46,680 --> 00:22:48,680
I'm trying to have a civil
conversation with you.

279
00:22:48,720 --> 00:22:49,880
Don't get so worked up.

280
00:22:50,119 --> 00:22:51,400
I'm not worked up.

281
00:22:52,519 --> 00:22:53,519
Fine.

282
00:22:54,440 --> 00:22:55,440
What about Ji Mingxuan?

283
00:22:56,400 --> 00:22:58,640
I heard he'll sleep with men or women.

284
00:22:59,039 --> 00:23:01,720
He's been linked to a
lot of young celebrities.

285
00:23:02,400 --> 00:23:03,759
Someone in Mingxuan's position

286
00:23:04,480 --> 00:23:06,519
is bound to attract some gossip.

287
00:23:07,200 --> 00:23:08,200
Rumors

288
00:23:09,079 --> 00:23:10,160
are still just rumors.

289
00:23:11,200 --> 00:23:12,279
As for how he treats me,

290
00:23:13,039 --> 00:23:14,559
you've already seen it for yourself.

291
00:23:17,680 --> 00:23:18,680
What about you?

292
00:23:19,240 --> 00:23:20,800
I've been abroad these past few years.

293
00:23:21,519 --> 00:23:23,159
The food and drinks weren't
nearly as good as here,

294
00:23:23,160 --> 00:23:24,720
and living there was even worse.

295
00:23:25,200 --> 00:23:26,839
I remember getting sick once.

296
00:23:27,559 --> 00:23:29,376
My family and friends were
thousands of miles away.

297
00:23:29,400 --> 00:23:31,039
No one was there

298
00:23:31,319 --> 00:23:32,440
when I needed help.

299
00:23:33,119 --> 00:23:35,559
Thank goodness An'an
was there to take care of me.

300
00:23:38,000 --> 00:23:39,960
You and An'an are the
ones meant for each other.

301
00:23:44,720 --> 00:23:45,720
Shen Mo.

302
00:23:46,640 --> 00:23:48,440
Don't you still owe me an explanation?

303
00:23:48,839 --> 00:23:50,559
Why did you break up with me back then?

304
00:23:50,880 --> 00:23:51,880
Why?

305
00:23:53,559 --> 00:23:54,720
I don't really remember.

306
00:23:56,400 --> 00:23:57,880
I guess we just weren't compatible.

307
00:23:59,200 --> 00:24:00,399
We'd been together since high school.

308
00:24:00,400 --> 00:24:02,038
After all those years,

309
00:24:02,039 --> 00:24:04,079
you're telling me we weren't compatible?

310
00:24:05,759 --> 00:24:07,599
What difference would another reason make?

311
00:24:08,359 --> 00:24:10,039
You're the Zhou family's only son.

312
00:24:11,680 --> 00:24:13,440
Would your parents ever let us be together?

313
00:24:15,079 --> 00:24:16,079
Yes.

314
00:24:16,559 --> 00:24:18,640
My father's very old-fashioned.

315
00:24:19,480 --> 00:24:21,640
He couldn't accept me dating another man.

316
00:24:22,480 --> 00:24:24,078
But I told you I'd find a way.

317
00:24:24,079 --> 00:24:25,319
I would've convinced them.

318
00:24:26,759 --> 00:24:28,919
Your solution was to
go abroad with Ji An'an

319
00:24:28,920 --> 00:24:30,799
and live happily ever after with her?

320
00:24:32,319 --> 00:24:34,079
I knew that was the reason.

321
00:24:34,200 --> 00:24:35,000
Yes.

322
00:24:35,079 --> 00:24:36,719
My parents arranged for me to go abroad.

323
00:24:36,799 --> 00:24:37,759
I went with An'an,

324
00:24:37,760 --> 00:24:40,479
but I don't have any feelings for her.

325
00:24:40,480 --> 00:24:42,159
As soon as I landed, I
bought a ticket back.

326
00:24:42,160 --> 00:24:42,920
And what happened?

327
00:24:43,000 --> 00:24:44,159
You refused to see me.

328
00:24:44,160 --> 00:24:45,760
I couldn't reach you for over two weeks.

329
00:24:45,799 --> 00:24:47,160
When you finally called,

330
00:24:47,279 --> 00:24:48,599
it was to break up with me.

331
00:24:51,319 --> 00:24:52,640
At first, I thought

332
00:24:53,000 --> 00:24:53,960
you were angry

333
00:24:53,960 --> 00:24:54,960
because I'd gone abroad.

334
00:24:55,079 --> 00:24:56,519
But looking back now,

335
00:24:57,359 --> 00:24:58,598
I bet that by then,

336
00:24:58,599 --> 00:24:59,959
you'd already crawled
into Ji Mingxuan's bed.

337
00:24:59,960 --> 00:25:00,960
Hadn't you?

338
00:25:03,200 --> 00:25:04,200
Shen Mo.

339
00:25:05,720 --> 00:25:07,759
I never thought you
were that kind of person.

340
00:25:08,119 --> 00:25:09,680
I can't believe I was so blind.

341
00:25:17,599 --> 00:25:19,160
I'm the one who was blind.

342
00:25:31,000 --> 00:25:34,119
Some people are beyond your reach.

343
00:25:36,079 --> 00:25:38,960
Stay away from Zhou Yang from now on.

344
00:25:39,599 --> 00:25:40,599
Otherwise,

345
00:25:41,880 --> 00:25:45,519
your family will pay the price next time.

346
00:25:45,839 --> 00:25:48,119
Do you hear me?
[Blade Scar Man]

347
00:26:15,119 --> 00:26:16,119
Zhou Yang.

348
00:26:17,440 --> 00:26:18,480
People change.

349
00:26:20,000 --> 00:26:21,680
Mingxuan can give me everything I want.

350
00:26:22,240 --> 00:26:23,240
We

351
00:26:24,920 --> 00:26:25,920
can't go back.

352
00:26:27,000 --> 00:26:28,000
Fine.

353
00:26:28,400 --> 00:26:29,880
So much for everything you want.

354
00:26:30,839 --> 00:26:32,440
Then stay with Ji Mingxuan

355
00:26:32,680 --> 00:26:34,680
and live the life you want.

356
00:26:56,640 --> 00:26:58,799
Mr. Ji isn't back yet.

357
00:27:00,599 --> 00:27:01,639
Don't turn on the lights.

358
00:27:03,720 --> 00:27:04,720
Mr. Ji.

359
00:27:05,759 --> 00:27:06,759
Why are the lights off?

360
00:27:08,720 --> 00:27:09,720
Come here.

361
00:27:28,039 --> 00:27:30,160
I wanted to have dinner with you today,

362
00:27:32,119 --> 00:27:33,879
but you seem to have been very busy lately.

363
00:27:36,440 --> 00:27:37,160
No.

364
00:27:37,160 --> 00:27:38,160
I'm sorry.

365
00:27:39,160 --> 00:27:40,319
I went to see Zhou Yang.

366
00:27:42,799 --> 00:27:45,160
Smart people learn from their mistakes.

367
00:27:45,519 --> 00:27:47,759
Fools keep making the same ones.

368
00:27:49,160 --> 00:27:50,160
Shen Mo.

369
00:27:50,440 --> 00:27:51,720
Which one are you?

370
00:27:52,240 --> 00:27:53,520
It doesn't matter if I'm a fool,

371
00:27:55,079 --> 00:27:56,599
as long as you're smart, Mr. Ji.

372
00:27:57,759 --> 00:27:59,240
I won't see Zhou Yang again.

373
00:28:00,519 --> 00:28:02,439
He and An'an are the
ones meant for each other.

374
00:28:03,319 --> 00:28:04,559
Good. At least you understand.

375
00:28:12,440 --> 00:28:13,440
You want me?

376
00:28:14,839 --> 00:28:16,039
Or

377
00:28:16,400 --> 00:28:18,200
did seeing Zhou Yang again

378
00:28:20,599 --> 00:28:22,519
bring back feelings you shouldn't have?

379
00:28:24,480 --> 00:28:25,480
No.

380
00:28:25,880 --> 00:28:26,880
Absolutely not.

381
00:28:28,680 --> 00:28:29,839
Then tell me,

382
00:28:30,839 --> 00:28:31,959
who are you thinking about?

383
00:28:33,960 --> 00:28:35,839
I want you, Mr. Ji.

384
00:28:39,079 --> 00:28:41,079
What did you call me?

385
00:28:45,359 --> 00:28:46,599
Mingxuan.

386
00:28:53,079 --> 00:28:55,119
You went to see Zhou Yang behind my back.

387
00:28:56,799 --> 00:28:58,400
How should I punish you?

388
00:29:02,759 --> 00:29:03,759
Mr. Ji.

389
00:29:05,559 --> 00:29:06,559
Mingxuan.

390
00:29:42,119 --> 00:29:43,400
Shen Mo.

391
00:29:48,599 --> 00:29:49,680
You're mine.

392
00:29:53,160 --> 00:29:54,480
I'm yours, Mingxuan.

393
00:29:57,039 --> 00:29:58,039
Yes.

394
00:29:58,480 --> 00:30:01,279
I'm just Mr. Ji's housekeeper.

395
00:30:58,200 --> 00:30:59,200
Zhou Yang.

396
00:31:01,799 --> 00:31:02,799
Who are you?

397
00:31:05,920 --> 00:31:06,920
My name is Ji Mingxuan.

398
00:31:12,359 --> 00:31:15,759
I'm just a toy for him to use.

399
00:31:28,200 --> 00:31:29,200
Have some water.

400
00:31:29,559 --> 00:31:30,559
You're tired, too.

401
00:31:30,920 --> 00:31:32,079
Get some sleep.

402
00:31:50,960 --> 00:31:52,519
You must be even more tired, Mr. Ji.

403
00:31:56,279 --> 00:31:57,799
I'll head back, then.
